en a prospect and the onboarding email address. It includes a proposal from the cabinet (Zied) and the client (Marion) accepting and providing details, asking questions, and wanting to proceed. The client expresses willingness to work together, wants the \\\"lettre de mission\\\", etc. This is onboarding. So accord = true.\\n\\nExplain short reason.{\\\"accord\\\": true, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"Le client accepte la proposition, fournit les informations requises et demande la mise en place du mandat, indiquant clairement son intention de démarrer la collaboration.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":126,\"promptTokens\":1685,\"totalTokens\":1811}}}"}}
