rom Zied (cabinet) to Marion (client) about proposal, Marion replies confirming and asking for letter of mission, wants to start. The email is from Eya Jallouli forwarding? But the content shows client Marion confirming intention to work together. This is indeed onboarding (new client). So accord true because client expresses desire to collaborate.\\n\\nWe need output JSON with \\\"accord\\\": true and short reason.\\n\\nLet's craft reason: \\\"Le client confirme vouloir démarrer la collaboration et demande la lettre de mission\\\".{\\\"accord\\\": true, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"Le client confirme qu'il souhaite démarrer la collaboration et demande la lettre de mission pour lancer les démarches.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":147,\"promptTokens\":1685,\"totalTokens\":1832}}}"}}
